sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Elder as Elderly User
    participant UI as Medication Screen
    participant Lib as lib/medication_tracking
    participant DB as Appwrite DB
    participant Notif as Notifications (Expo)

    Elder->>UI: Tap (+) Add Medication
    UI->>Elder: Show Form (Name, Dosage, Time)
    Elder->>UI: Fill details and "Save"
    
    UI->>Lib: createElderlyMedicationWithReminder(data)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Lib: Transaction-like operation
        Lib->>DB: createRow(ElderlyMedication)
        DB-->>Lib: Medication ID
        
        Lib->>DB: createRow(ElderlyMedicationReminder)
        DB-->>Lib: Reminder ID
    end
    
    Lib-->>UI: Success
    
    UI->>Notif: scheduleMedicationNotification(title, time)
    Notif->>Notif: Validates permission
    Notif->>Notif: Schedule local notification
    
    UI->>Elder: Show Success Message
    UI->>UI: Refresh List
    
    opt Daily Check Logic (On Screen Load)
        UI->>Lib: checkAndMarkSkippedMedications(userId)
        Lib->>DB: Fetch Active Reminders
        Lib->>DB: Fetch Today's Logs
        Lib->>Lib: Compare Time vs Now (Buffer 1min)
        alt Found Missed Meds
            Lib->>DB: updateRow(Log, status='missing')
        end
    end
